VERSION HISTORY

Version 1.0 - October 2025
  • External validation implementation
  • Bilingual interface (Dutch/English)
  • Integrated LEDD calculator (Jost et al. 2023 conversions)
  • Updated COMT inhibitor handling
  • Privacy-compliant analytics (Umami)
  • Expanded scope of application and limitations

================================================================================

PRIVACY & DATA PROTECTION

This calculator processes all data client-side in the user's browser. No 
patient data is transmitted to external servers or stored. Optional analytics 
(Umami) collect only aggregate, anonymous usage statistics in compliance with 
GDPR Article 6(1)(f) - no cookies or personal identifiers.

